accept_74411_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Shunan Expert Herbalist has superb skills and can cure any Insect Poison. He has been living years in seclusion and his whereabouts are unknown. After years of hard research, I finally got a clue about him on Hidden King Peak, so I wanted to send invitations to the Central Plains Wulin factions and gather to invite them, asking Expert Herbalist to come out and save the world. </font>
