accept_74423_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sworn brothers reaching up to the clouds, crescent moon halberd blade is cold. Surpassing everyone high above, sensory bereavement shakes Qiankun. You've come to worship the Martial Saint? </font>
