context_74423=Magnificent aspirations persevere, heroic spirit astounds. Solemnly stands the temple of ancestors, who is more brave than the lord? <br>Sworn brothers reaching up to the clouds, crescent moon halberd blade is cold. <br>Surpassing everyone high above, sensory bereavement shakes Qiankun. <br>Loyalty supports the state, courage protects the iron shoulders. <br>Path of great deeds is a path of no return, spirits of the brave turn into incense smoke.
menu_74423_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, sir.</font>
