accept_74427_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Want to present a greeting to the leaders of various sects, navigate the chessboard and welcome the new version, and celebrate the martial world together</font>
accept_74428_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As long as you log in during the event period, you can receive a prize from me every day!</font>
accept_74429_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young hero, your strength is extraordinary, and I have a good gift to give!</font>
accept_74440_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Swear brotherhood in the Peach Garden, the moon rests on the cold blade of the Green Dragon Sword.</font>
accept_74446_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Throughout history, the wise and virtuous have all been lonely, only those who drink leave their names behind. Fine wine not only gives people courage and strength, but also uplifts the spirit and inspires bravery in battle! The Drunken Song and Dance event is about to begin, so come and show off your skills, young hero!</font>
accept_74448_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >During the event, qualified martial artists can receive a certificate of assistance here.</font>
accept_74449_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >During the event, Jianghu VIPs of the martial world can come to me every day to receive the "Heart Demon Challenge" mission. Upon completion, they can receive a reward from the ambassador.</font>
complete_74427=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Here is your reward. Please take it.</font>
complete_74428=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wishing the hero a smooth journey!</font>
complete_74429=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wishing the hero a smooth journey!</font>
complete_74440=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >With grand ambitions and heroic spirit, you will be admired by all. Your noble appearance is admired by the people, and your loyalty and bravery are unmatched by anyone else.</font>
complete_74446=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Drinking brings joy and dispels worries! Not only do you know how to appreciate wine, but you also possess extraordinary skills and exceptional strength! Admiration, admiration!</font>
complete_74448=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hidden Meridians Add Power (Completed)</font>
complete_74449=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is your reward, please take it.</font>
context_74427=Lin Tiannan, the leader of the martial arts alliance, presents a greeting card, welcoming the new version and celebrating the martial arts world. By completing the task, you can receive generous rewards from Lin Tiannan.
context_74428=During the event, all Jianghu VIPs in the martial arts world can receive a "Martial Arts Gift Pack" from the martial arts ambassador in Suzhou (390,768) every day.
context_74429=During the event, Jianghu VIPs will go to the mysterious old man in Suzhou (who does good deeds) (390,735) to complete the task of verifying their strength by talking to him and receive a Hidden World Promotion Token *1.
context_74440=After paying respects to the Martial Saint at the Jinling <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_sworn002" style="HLStype1">Guanzhi (Imperial Temple Sworn Brother Guide)</a>, players can challenge the Martial Saint's attendants.
context_74446=Successfully complete 1 Heart Demon challenge.
context_74447=During the event, Jianghu VIPs can receive a task from the NPC in Suzhou who changes names (Name Change Ambassador) (395,740): Help the Alliance Leader enter the Hidden World. Upon completion of the task, players can obtain a letter from Lin Tiannan *1.
context_74448=During the event, Jianghu VIPs who have opened the Six Inner Age of Wushu Record (Demon's Trace Appears) plan can go to the NPC in Suzhou, renamed (Renaming Ambassador) (395,740) to talk and accept the "Hidden Meridians Assistance" task. Upon completion, they will receive a certificate of assistance for reversing the meridians.
context_74449=During the event, Jianghu VIPs can go to the Shangwu Ambassador (390,768) in Suzhou every day to accept the "Heart Demon Challenge" task. Upon completion, they can receive a reward from the ambassador.
