context_74434=During the event, Jianghu VIPs in the martial arts world can go to the Suzhou Xiangjun (cart driver) (645, 433) to receive the "Unforgettable Master's Favor" task. They can send a message to their sect expressing their longing for their master: "Through the ups and downs of the martial arts world, do not forget the favor of your master!" Upon completion of the task, they will receive an unforgettable gift from their master. Find Xiangjun to receive the unforgettable gift from your master.
