CanAcceptMenu_74435=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Helping the melon farmer in a righteous and brave manner (accetpable)</font>
CompleteMenu_74435=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Helping the melon farmer in a righteous and brave manner (can be submitted)</font>
accept_74435_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, that Zhu Bapi causes trouble here every day. How can we live like this?</font>
complete_74435=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your help, young hero. I hope you were not harmed on your journey!</font>
context_74435=The watermelon harvest has been good this summer, but the old farmer is worried and has a troubled expression. The local bully, Zhu Bapi, comes to the melon fields every day to cause trouble and take what he wants. When we see injustice, we must stand up and fight for what is right. I ask all the heroes to help the farmer get justice.
menu_74435_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't worry, sir. I will go and teach him a lesson.</font>
next_74435=Helping the farmer and standing up for what is right
submit_74435=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's just a small matter</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, nothing to worry about. I'll beat him up in just a few hits.</font>
target_74435=Drive away <a href="findnpc_new,city05,npc_hd_zlw_01" style="HLStype1">Zhu Bapi</a>, who is causing trouble in the fields.
title_74435=Helping the farmer and standing up for what is right
