accept_74436_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The holiday of lovers is upon us once again. Lady Zhi is here in person to bless us all! Go now to the Temple of the Old Matchmaker to pay your respects.</font>
accept_74437_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The holiday of lovers is upon us once again. Seventh Sister is here on her birthday to bless us all! Go now to the Temple of the Old Matchmaker to pay your respects.</font>
complete_74436=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are truly clever. I can see that you are married. Are you here to pray for blessings for your beloved one? Please accept this small gift and enjoy the many flavors of life with your beloved. Your beloved will surely achieve great success in the future.</font>
complete_74437=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are still young and inexperienced. Here is a gift for you. You still need to experience the many flavors of life and live earnestly. Your beloved will naturally come into your life.
context_74436=Qixi is a traditional Chinese holiday, on which couples eat Qiao Guo. Women worship Zhinü together, praying for their loved ones to achieve success and also for their own intelligence. Young girls unite to worship the Seven Sisters, hoping to find their ideal husband. Therefore, it is also known as the "Qiqiao Festival".
context_74437=Qixi is a traditional Chinese holiday, on which couples eat Qiao Guo. Women worship Zhinü together, praying for their loved ones to achieve success and also for their own intelligence. Young girls unite to worship the Seven Sisters, hoping to find their ideal husband. Therefore, it is also known as the "Qiqiao Festival".
